%N A393230 Numbers k such that sigma(k) = psi(k) + phi(k) + Omega(k)^3.
%C A393230 a(21) > 10^22. - _Max Alekseyev_, Oct 25 2026
%e A393230 2288 is a term since sigma(2288) = 5208 = 4032 + 960 + 6^3 = psi(2288) + phi(2288) + Omega(2288)^3.
%o A393230 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); sigma(f) == prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) + eulerphi(f) + bigomega(f)^3; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Feb 06 2026
